{"4603580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AI CARAMBA", "steam_appid": 4603580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Protected Your Job</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Caramba is a <strong>top-down survivors roguelite</strong> where waves of AI-powered IoT devices stand between you and your paycheck. Pick your profession, build your loadout, and survive long enough to clock out for the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/2874a8af198a37432587489846c7e605.poster.avif?t=1779736205\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/2874a8af198a37432587489846c7e605.webm?t=1779736205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/2874a8af198a37432587489846c7e605.mp4?t=1779736205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Create Unique Builds</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of workers, each with their own <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>styles</strong>. Smash your enemies with <strong>physics-driven</strong> chaos, grow stronger with <strong>random upgrades</strong>, and <strong>unleash destruction</strong> on the machines that threaten your livelihood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/0a96d133a9fe0eafa700903171c61ff6.poster.avif?t=1779736205\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/0a96d133a9fe0eafa700903171c61ff6.webm?t=1779736205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/0a96d133a9fe0eafa700903171c61ff6.mp4?t=1779736205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Broaden Your Horizons</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to <strong>unlock new scenarios, abilities, playable characters </strong>and <strong>upgrades</strong>, opening up new strategies as you play through the game. Survive for as long as you can, until you are inevitably fired and replaced. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Protected Your Job</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Caramba is a <strong>top-down survivors roguelite</strong> where waves of AI-powered IoT devices stand between you and your paycheck. Pick your profession, build your loadout, and survive long enough to clock out for the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/2874a8af198a37432587489846c7e605.poster.avif?t=1779736205\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/2874a8af198a37432587489846c7e605.webm?t=1779736205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4603580/extras/2874a8af198a37432587489846c7e605.mp4?t=1779736205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Create Unique Builds</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of workers, each with their own <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>styles</strong>. Smash your enemies with <strong>physics-driven</strong> chaos, grow stronger with <strong>random upgrades</strong>, and <strong>unleash destruction</strong> on the machine